Revision history for RT-Extension-WeatherWidget

1.0.0  2026-04-26
  - Initial release
  - Reads City / Zip / Country from the logged-in RT user's profile
  - Geocoding via Nominatim (OpenStreetMap), weather via Open-Meteo
  - WMO weather-code mapping with German labels and emoji icons
  - Condition-specific gradient panels (sunny / cloudy / rain / snow / storm / fog / night)
  - Theme-aware outer widget via Bootstrap CSS variables
  - 30-minute sessionStorage cache to avoid redundant API calls
  - Manual refresh button
  - Friendly no-location state with link to user profile
  - HTMX-safe self-cleaning timer
